description.content:
**如何创建一个无规格产品**

<details>
  <summary>新建无规格产品</summary>

```
{
  "images": [],
  "name": "testname",
  "product_no": "testno",
  "product_type": 1,
  "package_remark": "remark"
  }
```
</details>
参数列表中有罗列可传入参数以及数据类型

**如何编辑一个无规格产品**

<details>
  <summary>编辑无规格产品</summary>
```
{
  "product_id":xxxxxx,
  "images": [],
  "name": "testname",
  "product_no": "test",
  "product_type": 1,
  "package_remark": "remark"
  }
```
</details>
编辑无规格产品，需要获取info接口中的product_id传入，参数列表中有罗列可传入参数以及数据类型。


===========================================================================================

**如何创建一个多规格产品**

<details>
  <summary>新建多规格产品</summary>

```
{
	"images": [],
	"name": "测试23",
	"product_no": "编号12",
	"product_type": 2,
	"sku_items": [{
		"sku_code": "测试11",
		"attributes": [{
			"item_id": 2056386462650, --规格类型id
			"value": {
				"item_id": 2268631617468  --规格值id
			}
		}],
		"fob_price": 123,
		"disable_flag": 0
	}, {
		"sku_code": "测试21",
		"attributes": [{
			"item_id": 2056386462650, --规格类型id
			"value": {
				"item_id": 2268631617469 --规格值id
			}
		}],
		"fob_price": 123,
		"disable_flag": 0
	}],
	"package_remark": "备注",
	"sku_attributes": [{
    --需要包含sku_items使用的规格值与类型，如item_id规格类型 2056386462650有使用规格值2268631617469/2268631617468，则都需要填写进来
		"item_id": 2056386462650,
		"value": [{
			"item_id": 2268631617469
		}, {
			"item_id": 2268631617468
		}]
	}]
}

```
</details>
创建多规格需要通过https://api-sandbox.xiaoman.cn/v1/product/push-sku-attribute ，创建规格后，item_id是由https://api-sandbox.xiaoman.cn/v1/product/sku-attribute-list 获得，用于创建多规格产品。多规格sku_attributes与sku_items必填，
参数列表中有罗列可传入参数以及数据类型。

**如何编辑一个多规格产品**
<details>
  <summary>编辑多规格产品</summary>

```
    {
  "images": [],
  "name": "测试2",
  "product_no": "编号1",
  "product_type": 2,
    "product_id":xxxxxx,
  "sku_items": [
    {
      "sku_id":xxxxxx,
      "sku_code": "测试1",
      "attributes": [
        {
          "item_id": 2056386462650, --规格类型id
          "value": {
            "item_id": 2268631617468 --规格值id
          }
        }
      ],
      "fob_price": 123,
      "disable_flag": 0
    }
  ],
  "package_remark": "备注",
  "sku_attributes": [
    {
      "item_id": 2056386462650,   --规格类型id
      "value": [
        {
          "item_id": 2268631617468 --规格值id
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

```
</details>
编辑多规格产品，需要获取info接口中的product_id与sku_id传入，参数列表中有罗列可传入参数以及数据类型。




离岸价传参
<details>
  <summary>离岸价</summary>
    ```
1. fob_type = 1（ 单一区间定价） 
{
  "product_no": "PROD001",
  "name": "Sample Product",
  "product_type": 1,
  "fob_type": 1,
  "price_currency": "USD",
  "price_min": 8.0,
  "price_max": 12.0,
  "quantity": 100,
  "quantity_unit": "PCS",
  "price_unit": "USD/PCS"
}
2. fob_type = 2（ 阶梯定价） 
{
  "product_no": "PROD002",
  "name": "Sample Product",
  "product_type": 1,
  "fob_type": 2,
  "price_currency": "USD",
  "gradient_price": [{
    "quantity": "100",
    "price": "10.0"
  }, {
    "quantity": "500",
    "price": "9.5"
  }, {
    "quantity": "1000",
    "price": "9.0"
  }],
  "quantity_unit": "PCS",
  "price_unit": "USD/PCS"
}
3. fob_type = 3（ 固定单价） 
{
  "product_no": "PROD003",
  "name": "Sample Product",
  "product_type": 1,
  "fob_type": 3,
  "price_currency": "USD",
  "fob_price": 10.5,
  "quantity": 100,
  "quantity_unit": "PCS",
  "price_unit": "USD/PCS"
}
    ```
</details>

